 "intro_zh": "白洋淀是河北第一大内陆湖，总面积366平方公里。景区自古就以物产丰富、风景秀丽闻名。主要景点有元妃荷园、荷花大观园、鸳鸯岛、休闲岛、异国风情园、宝岛水上游乐园、白洋淀文化苑、白洋淀渔人乐园、王家寨民俗村。",
 "intro_en": "Baiyang Lake, also known as Lake Baiyangdian, is located in the Xiong'an New Area of Baoding, a prefecture-level city in Hebei Province, China. It is the largest freshwater lake in northern China. It is referred to as the Kidney of North China.",
 "intro_en_source": "wikipedia",
